{
  "about": "The calls each case of project_functions.json and project_activation.json made through its scripted host-functions port, and where its run started reading its study input (input), in order, as host_functions.rs logs them. Each list is the moved test's own record: the host calls of its trace, the arguments it recorded in call order, and its input read, which FUNC-12 places after the lock verification, the bindings and every case of the called functions, and before any call for study data (FUNC-8). A lock verification names the called functions only, each with its callable, which carries the tests' called_functions check and their double's checks on the lock and the callables it verified; a log without one is a build that verified no lock, and a log without input one that read no study input.",
